  "description": "meme-id: illegal_immigration_the_cowboy_way; hasOverallIntent: Hateful; overall-intent-description: The image depicts a man in cowboy attire holding a rifle, juxtaposed with the text 'illegal immigration the cowboy way' and 'we'll know them if they try to come back in!'. This visual and textual combination uses a violent, stereotypical 'cowboy' archetype to dehumanize and threaten individuals associated with undocumented immigration. The intent is to portray immigrants as dangerous, undesirable, and deserving of punitive force, which constitutes a hateful message targeting a specific ethnic/racial group (Latino/Hispanic communities) by invoking harmful stereotypes about immigration and criminality. The imagery of a gun and the threatening tone of the text are designed to incite fear and hostility toward immigrants, fitting the definition of a hateful meme.",
